1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:03,600
(Leonard:)I didn't want you ending up
with a bad grade and get discouraged...

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:06,110
(Leonard:)...and give up on the idea
of going back to school.

3
00:00:06,282 --> 00:00:09,342
(Penny:)Right, because me being in school
is so important to you.

4
00:00:09,552 --> 00:00:12,852
(Penny:)That way, you wouldn't have to be dating
someone who's only a waitress.

5
00:00:13,056 --> 00:00:15,026
(Leonard:)Come on, you know that's not true.

6
00:00:15,191 --> 00:00:17,521
(Penny:)Do I? Listen to me.
I need to do this on my own.

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,890
(Penny:)If I fail, I fail. If I pass, I pass.
Do you get it?

8
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:24,690
- I'm sorry, I was just trying to help.
- Yeah, well, next time, don't.

9
00:00:25,601 --> 00:00:27,571
(Penny:)Oh. And since you like stories so much...

10
00:00:27,804 --> 00:00:30,034
(Penny:)...this is not the shoemaker
and the elves, okay?

11
00:00:30,206 --> 00:00:32,036
This is give a man a fish, he eats it.

12
00:00:32,208 --> 00:00:34,338
Teach a man to fish,
he sells it or something.

13
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:38,570
Whatever, I don't know. It's just
a lot better than what you did, you big jerk!

14
00:00:43,853 --> 00:00:47,313
- You ever hear back from Hawking?
- No.

15
00:00:47,523 --> 00:00:49,513
(Sheldon:)It would appear as if I've lost him.

16
00:00:49,726 --> 00:00:51,856
(Sheldon:)Stupid brain.

17
00:00:53,796 --> 00:00:56,596
- It'll be okay.
- How can it be okay?

18
00:00:56,833 --> 00:01:00,063
(Sheldon:)Stephen Hawking's a genius
and he talks like a robot.

